BUG 3: app/services/search_demand_service.py imported QueryProvenance
from app.models.query (wrong module — that class lives in the separate
file app/models/query_provenance.py). This was a hard ImportError that
blocked the ENTIRE application from booting — not a narrow issue, since
FastAPI imports the full router tree (including telemetry -> search
demand service) at startup. Fixed by splitting the import to pull each
class from its correct module.

